OL,5,G0420 7 Up: The Story
OL,6,     FIn 1964, ITV broadcast a film
OL,7,     Fabout 14 seven-year-olds, which
OL,8,     Fbecame the longest-running
OL,9,     Fdocumentary series ever. It set
OL,10,     Fout to prove that Britain was
OL,11,     Fdivided by the class system and
OL,12,     Fthat these children's futures had
OL,13,     Fbeen decided by the street they
OL,14,     Fwere born on. This programme looks
OL,15,     Fat the year 7 Up was made, the
OL,16,     Fidea behind it, and what the
OL,17,     Fsubjects hoped for in a Britain
OL,18,     Fabout to change around them
OL,19,G0450 Unwind with STV
OL,20,     FDaily escape designed to calm the
OL,21,     Fmind and encourage relaxation and
OL,22,     Freflection
